   "error": "Warning: Permanently added '100.111.0.118' (ED25519) to the  / exit code null / exit code 255 / Warning: Permanently added '[194.93.49.15]:20007' (ED25519)  / error: server error: SOCKS5 connect to 127.0.0.1:41056 → 100 / Traceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<string>\", line 1 / exit code 1",
   "count": 96,
   "message": "⛔ 我用 run_process 栽过 96 次,反复同一个坑。每次都浪费一轮对话,污染 commands 表。我现在记住了: 诊断错误根因再重试,不要原样重发。 别再来第 97 次。",
   "fix": "诊断错误根因再重试,不要原样重发。"
